      "text": "The legislative proposals which are submitted will be reviewed and the Mayor's Legislative Coordinating Committee and the various departments and agencies will thereafter be notified as to which proposals are acceptable as part of the City's program. When necessary, representatives of the affected City agencies will meet with the Legislative Co-ordinating Committee prior to any policy decision by the Committee. The legislation to the various departments and agencies will also contain further information relating to the pre-filing procedure which, as you know, will be in effect on November 15th.",
